                        "entry_id": "f0f67fc1-7ad1-396e-8b7c-9b1389059bfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A form of gunlock, in which the priming is ignited by a spark."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "61e86917-c7c7-3742-9b82-71735e1ab6dc",
                        "entry_id": "f0f67fc1-7ad1-396e-8b7c-9b1389059bfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A firearm using such a gunlock."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77ae2333-d832-4ce9-a8fe-ae244d255d41",
                                "sense_id": "61e86917-c7c7-3742-9b82-71735e1ab6dc",
                                "text": "He looked round for his gun, but in place of the clean well-oiled fowing-piece, he found an old firelock lying by him, the barrel encrusted with rust, the lock falling off, and the stock worm-eaten."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee553ebc-642c-4922-b693-d7ba92835167",
                                "sense_id": "61e86917-c7c7-3742-9b82-71735e1ab6dc",
                                "text": "Alfred, surprised to meet his father, whom he thought absent from home, […] stood, holding his firelock in one hand, and his hat in the other […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc591758-b4e5-4cad-b7c0-6bbf7fde1d35",
                                "sense_id": "61e86917-c7c7-3742-9b82-71735e1ab6dc",
                                "text": "Before we were out of the forest, however, we saw about ten peasants, some armed with firelocks [translating Feuer-rohren], others busy burying something."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
